  "resume": "This record is a dossier compiled by the Swiss Representation in Paris covering French initiatives to protect natural, historical, legendary, and picturesque sites between 1908 and 1911. It contains correspondence and reports gathered from French sources during that period. The dossier serves as a compilation of foreign policy-relevant information rather than a primary source of the protected sites themselves."
